type: software
message: >-
  Please cite this software when using it. The final Sc I calibration-paper
  citation remains to be verified; no paper DOI is assigned here.
title: "sc_teff_method: K-band Sc I temperature calibration for cool giant stars"
authors:
  - family-names: Thorsbro
    given-names: Brian
version: 0.1.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/thorsbro/sc_teff_method"
url: "https://github.com/thorsbro/sc_teff_method"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Python implementation of two frozen Gaussian line-area calibrations on the
  Nandakumar et al. (2023) temperature scale, with fixed-subset empirical
  validation statistics from the 5 October 2026 nine-line snapshot.
keywords:
  - astronomy
  - stellar effective temperatures
  - scandium
  - cool giant stars
